[8.536838, "i", "cat /app/vatnotes/ROUTE.txt && printf '\\n--- forms ---\\n' && cat /app/vatnotes/forms.txt\n"]
[8.537293, "o", "cat /app/vatnotes/ROUTE.txt && printf '\\n--- forms ---\\n' && cat /app/vatnotes/forms.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[8.538586, "o", "Capture mill modules:\r\n\r\n- /app/cordspin\r\n- /app/chunkvat\r\n- /app/emitbay\r\n\r\nCLI hull lives under /app/flaxcli. Rebuild with /app/hull.sh. Desk also links with make -C /app/flaxcli -f hull.mk OUT=/tmp/flaxcord.ref.\r\n\r\n`--serial-decode` joins decode workers one at a time. Ops turned it on when differ went red; unreels still matched.\r\n"]
[8.538826, "o", "\r\n--- forms ---\r\n"]
[8.539805, "o", "Compact file (little endian):\r\n\r\nFLX1\r\nu64 stamp\r\nu32 nstr\r\nnstr times: u16 len, len bytes (no NUL)\r\nu32 nsamp\r\nnsamp times: u16 depth, depth u32 ids, u32 hits\r\nu32 nlab\r\nnlab times: u16 len, len bytes (chunk label)\r\n\r\nunreel line: joined frames with '>' then space COUNT space hits\r\n\r\ndiffer writes /app/cordwell/differ.txt\r\n  quiet\r\nor\r\n  noisy\r\n\r\nCapture chunk text:\r\nSEQ <n>\r\n<frame>\r\n...\r\nHITS <n>\r\nEND\r\n"]
